(2. Method) Tj T*
(We adopt a U-Net backbone with residual blocks and train with Dice loss.) Tj T*
(Test-time augmentation is applied to estimate predictive uncertainty.) Tj T*
(Let x denote the input image and y the segmentation mask. We minimize) Tj T*
(L = 1 - 2|P ? G| / \(|P| + |G|\) over the training set.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Experiments) Tj T*
(To assess generalization, we evaluate the model on independent target) Tj T*
(domain data and compare its performance with a source domain baseline.) Tj T*
(A change in image appearance alone does not tell us how much the) Tj T*
(segmentation performance will decrease; this requires experimental) Tj T*
(evidence. Results are summarized in Table 1.) Tj T*
ET
